he most  important thing about Ezekiel is that he  makes a powerful ally to Rick and a town  of Alexandria the kingdom has the power  and the numbers to take negan and the  Savior's down but Ezekiel isn't easily  persuaded in the comics the kingdom  becomes a key factor in the war against  vegan and it seems like that'll be a big  part of this season's storyline  for more TV movies and Walking Dead keep  it here to GameSpot universe turn these  people in I mean the ones that are left
 

